# Keep Go files LF in the working tree as well as in the blob.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf=true checks them out CRLF on Windows and `gofmt -l`
# then lists every file in the repo, because gofmt objects to the carriage
# returns. That is a false positive nobody should have to learn to ignore, and
# hecato carries it as a documented annoyance rather than a fix. This is the fix.
*.go text eol=lf
go.mod text eol=lf
go.sum text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
